      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "塔妮",
            "content": "哇，麦尼尔太太，好久不见，您居然已经把“黄昏突进号”变成了这——么大的温泉度假村！好熟悉的温泉味道，我差点以为回到家了呢！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4235_thumpy_excited",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "thumpy",
              "animationName": "Interact",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "你家乡的大家非常热情，我在那里不仅学会了经营度假村，还吃胖了一圈呢。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "agoldw",
              "animationName": "Talk",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "塔妮",
            "content": "我猜猜，您喜欢的肯定是老彼得家的脆皮胡萝卜派！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4235_thumpy",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "一次三个不成问题！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "unit_animation",
          "data": {
            "id": "tmslot",
            "animationName": "Smile",
            "pauseOnEnd": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "阿梅利亚",
            "content": "那个，麦尼尔太太，悄悄问一嘴——现在的温泉度假村，能帮您还清债务吗？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4236_tmslot_softsmile",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "还差不少。不过，只要继续努力就不成问题。一想到这个，每天打扫温泉池子都浑身是劲！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "阿梅利亚",
            "content": "太好了......",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4236_tmslot_softsmile",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "不说我了。你们旅行回来了？旅途可还顺利？",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "嗯！发生了很多事，但好在我们最后坚持到了目的地。",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "unit_animation",
          "data": {
            "id": "jcinta",
            "animationName": "Salute",
            "pauseOnEnd": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "出发之前，没有想过自己能走那么远。可现在，觉得自己还能去更多的地方呢。",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "嘉辛塔",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4237_jcinta_relieved",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "我们都在旅途中找到了自己喜欢的新站点。",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "对了，我去给你们准备几张免费体验券，你们可以先到处转转。要是看到可以改进的地方，一定要告诉我哦。",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "agoldw",
              "animationName": "Talk",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
